{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0163_1000_p", "source_sha256": "0d8543e8171caf9bc2fca5f8a49cfb9b37d6123c0f177d2aa08bcac11838caa7", "ja": "（『アイグラ！！』の撮影で海辺までやってきた。\nちょっと遅れてしまったが、えっと、真はどこに？）", "zh": "（为了《偶像写真！！》的拍摄来到了海边。\n虽然稍微迟到了点，不过，那个，真在哪里呢？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0163_1001_006mak", "source_sha256": "6d8b40de952e1584de8ce9d3dc3bcf1c6f2d9628d44f990cda120ea263a14d7b", "ja": "ぅぉぉぉおおおおお！　……っと。\nあっ、{$P$}、お疲れさまです！", "zh": "呜哦哦哦哦哦哦哦！……呃。啊，{$P$}，辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0163_1002_p", "source_sha256": "04a18595fd5371e2999df7f98b8f41b8cdddb2318c2c83b1f5e1e56b535e9991", "ja": "お、おお、真！　お疲れさま……。\nえっと、何で全力疾走してるんだ？", "zh": "哦、哦哦，真！辛苦了……。\n那个，你为什么在全力奔跑？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0163_1003_006mak", "source_sha256": "43dba8a4e795c131464698da57da113b0153a5bf4f59137a43cf894254c22ecc", "ja": "今日の撮影で、『恋人と追いかけっこをする少女』\nっていうカットがあるじゃないですか？", "zh": "今天的拍摄里，不是有个“和恋人你追我赶的少女”这样的镜头吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0163_1004_006mak", "source_sha256": "a2df6203a9fa1f84d4acace83812a1a7a6bdfd39568d8aef4f24a13382370dcd", "ja": "だから、ちょっと走り込みしてたんです！\nいやぁ、潮風を浴びて走るのって、気持ちいいですね！", "zh": "所以，我特意练了一会儿跑步！\n哎呀，迎着海风奔跑的感觉真是舒服啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0163_1005_p", "source_sha256": "6f8bd89095ac799157c421af19aae7a110b273b1c369d1e6a03842ca5ce28350", "ja": "な、なるほど……。でも、そんな速さで\n走るような想定ではないと思うんだが……。", "zh": "原、原来如此……不过，我觉得应该没预想要以那么快的速度跑步吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0163_1006_006mak", "source_sha256": "2e9f8d20a2c2bdb8a50d504a0fb63811c98b2e158e915916758674e90714f52f", "ja": "もっと速く走れますよ！　でも、ひとりで走っても、\n追いかけっこのイメージがしづらいんですよね。", "zh": "我还能跑得更快哦！不过，一个人跑的话，\n总觉得很难想象出互相追逐的感觉呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0163_1007_006mak", "source_sha256": "7f929596ea00ee0d6dc37cd22c3d5b22a35953bc4720fdc8e2b772ba238db004", "ja": "何回か走ってみれば、わかるかなと思ったんですけど、\nまだ走り足りないのかなぁ……？", "zh": "我本来想着多跑几次，或许就能明白了，可是……难道还是跑得不够吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0163_1008_p", "source_sha256": "890a97e960f79b857f71c2085e40a83fbdbd50bd1a13102e23915d0494c7a606", "ja": "いや、そういう問題じゃないかも……。", "zh": "不，可能不是这个问题……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0163_1009_006mak", "source_sha256": "2c4c47d2b4d3504630b60e866cfbe92002f3286ecbe9b8bc468c1c090ce4d721", "ja": "そうだ、{$P$}！\nちょっと練習に付き合ってもらえませんか？", "zh": "对了，{$P$}！\n能陪我练习一下吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0163_1010_006mak", "source_sha256": "c003f2392f54a8c899bca49bc3ca803279595dc07873116960e060b09a04929f", "ja": "ふたりで走ってみれば、\nきっとイメージがしやすいと思うんです！", "zh": "要不我们两个人一起跑跑看，我觉得这样肯定更容易找到感觉！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0163_1011_p", "source_sha256": "d3f3b80f10936e4a6897d59bc5c437ec836442e10a3ea66978bc608702c4de69", "ja": "おお、もちろん協力するぞ。想定では、恋人同士が\nじゃれ合うように砂浜を追いかけっこして……。", "zh": "哦，当然会帮忙。按照设想，恋人之间要像打情骂俏一样，在沙滩上你追我赶……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0163_1012_006mak", "source_sha256": "75a8e246e5bb53ca00c1fd67be4151e91127c8cf690250dd401ba9c0cdc0a6af", "ja": "ありがとうございます！　それじゃあ、ボクが\n全力で逃げてみますから、追いかけてきてください！", "zh": "太感谢您了！那我就\n全力逃跑试试看，请在后面追我吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0163_1013_p", "source_sha256": "4b06aa15e86ec741a54b10debb8666b497b0fc11825e32469033fc1e08a4f2ed", "ja": "よし、わかった！　って、\n全力……？", "zh": "好，明白了！不过，全力……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0163_1014_006mak", "source_sha256": "20f9b241e83dc94e8cd6c0a90205c929f1d1e77d7e0723db204a89a5c8cf8412", "ja": "10本目っと！　へへっ、{$P$}、\nボクのこと、なかなか捕まえられませんね♪", "zh": "第10趟啦！嘿嘿，{$P$}，\n想抓到我可没那么容易呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0163_1015_p", "source_sha256": "f8467ed270a897a7e9b968fd9a82c7b9bd37efb8ae8aaecd303486e48188337f", "ja": "ハァッ、ハァッ……。ま、真が……速すぎるん……\nだよ……。そんな本気で……逃げなくても……。", "zh": "哈啊、哈啊……真、真是……跑得太快了……\n也不用这么认真地……逃跑吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0163_1016_006mak", "source_sha256": "0f011d29b5afdeebef04d3cae432203b98fd08e53147a40e08e9db52e17dd7e1", "ja": "ボクだって捕まえてほしいんですよ？　でも、\n捕まえられたらそこで終わっちゃうから……ああっ！", "zh": "我也想让你抓住我啊？可是，要是被抓住的话，就到此为止了……啊啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0163_1017_006mak", "source_sha256": "7ad7ed41cd6f6cbee33bc91858e51735a9f3fb508267dcb668e6cb09dc638e32", "ja": "そっか、この気持ちが……。{$P$}、\n『恋人と追いかけっこ』のコツ、掴めた気がします！", "zh": "原来如此，这就是这种感觉啊……。{$P$}，我好像已经掌握和恋人玩追逐游戏的诀窍了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0163_1018_p", "source_sha256": "39c986f7da9b18f2ae21b224cc3808221638bf3e3f6022ccb716889c6bc12c7f", "ja": "そ、それは、なによりだ……。\nなら、撮影は、大丈夫そうだな……はぁ、はぁ。", "zh": "那、那真是太好了……  \n这样一来，拍摄应该没问题了吧……呼、呼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0163_1019_006mak", "source_sha256": "f55e62ff52e1086b08afbd017c2fbfbbd106b04a023298ef98506c25187377b0", "ja": "はい！　あ、でも\nこの感じを忘れないようにしたいんで……。", "zh": "好的！啊，不过我想记住现在这种感觉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0163_1020_006mak", "source_sha256": "56ef5e271aab4affb675ac95d565e9126d546849f844f35e4cbddde9299342a8", "ja": "もうちょっと練習に付き合ってください！\n……それじゃ、行きますよ！　それーっ！", "zh": "请再陪我练习一会儿！\n……那么，要开始了哦！嘿——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0163_1021_p", "source_sha256": "e28c57b55061e977fa9f75c7fd41ab421662b466cdf4d1372e02d238ddd42f57", "ja": "（ま、まだ走るのか……。よし、こうなったら\n真が納得するまで付き合おう。頑張れ俺の体……！）", "zh": "（还、还要跑吗……。好，既然这样，就陪真练到她满意为止吧。加油啊，我的身体……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
